# Xray

## What is Xray?

Xray is a small X11 test suite to test window management behavior, mostly trying
to mimick what games do (resizing, fullscreen, modesetting etc.). It tests both
spec-required behaviors and non-required (but desirable) behaviors from the
compositor + WM + Xserver implementation combo.

## How do I use it?

To use it, install the X11 development libraries, then build it with "make".
Once built, run all the tests with "./xray"

